  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nOnce per turn, at the start of the Damage Step,
    if a monster battles a monster: You can return this card to the hand, and if
    you do, banish 1 Spell from your Deck. For that battle, your monster cannot be
    destroyed, also the battle damage you take is halved.\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \nWhen
    this card inflicts battle damage to your opponent: You can add 1 \"Supreme King
    Dragon\" monster, \"Supreme King Gate\" monster, or \"Soul of the Supreme King\"
    from your Deck to your hand. Once per turn, during the Standby Phase: Activate
    this effect; each player can banish 1 Spell from their Deck. Once per turn, when
    a monster declares an attack: Activate this effect; the attacked player can apply
    the following effect.\r\n\u25CF Add 1 of your banished Spells to your hand, then
    discard it, and if you do, negate that attack."
